    "title": "前瞻性投资系统",
    "category": 4,
    "header": "前瞻性投资系统",
    "content": "<p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"07e4da998aa953d1b01d2bd7c727aa63\" title=\"克莱布拉松地区接收计划草稿.png\" alt=\"克莱布拉松地区接收计划草稿.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/07e4da998aa953d1b01d2bd7c727aa63.png\"/></div><p></p><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        考虑到该地区先前的抵抗与破坏程度，各公爵对这里兴趣缺缺。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        根据惯例，先划归领土接壤的公爵代为管理。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        今后会根据情况重新探讨此地未来的规划。</span></span></em></span></h5><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"e9a293e4b4368309da478c01b8eba824\" title=\"前瞻性投资系统.png\" alt=\"前瞻性投资系统.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/e9a293e4b4368309da478c01b8eba824.png\"/></div><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"34d8defc211985826003383d33f46c81\" title=\"22.png\" alt=\"22.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20220826/34d8defc211985826003383d33f46c81.png\"/></div><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【前瞻性投资系统】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">是由坎诺特经营的特殊系统，当您行至</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【诡意行商】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点时，将有概率出现在坎诺特的商店中。当该系统第一次出现后，则本次探险的每一个</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【诡意行商】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点都会出现</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【前瞻性投资系统】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以在</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【前瞻性投资系统】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中消耗源石锭进行存款，当您的存款累计至一定额度时，将会获得对应的投资奖赏。投资系统的存款将会在每一次的探索中继承，旨在让您养成良好的投资理财习惯，以备不时之需。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" alt=\"分割线.png\" title=\"分割线.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\"></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"4a4d3449848e374d364a7e4a2285dce7\" title=\"23.png\" alt=\"23.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/4a4d3449848e374d364a7e4a2285dce7.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\" id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" alt=\"分割线.png\" title=\"分割线.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/is/upload/pic/20211229/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap float-left\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"37b57ea92670b2e3e9c3e0e80cbc08dd\" title=\"24.png\" alt=\"24.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/37b57ea92670b2e3e9c3e0e80cbc08dd.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">当您的历史最高投资额达到200时，</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【前瞻性投资系统】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中将会解锁</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【余额提取】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">功能，当坎诺特的商店中出现</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【前瞻性投资系统】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">时，则当前无论投资是否受限，都可以进行</span><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【余额提取】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:1.1875em\"><span style=\"color:#ffb525\">【余额提取】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以将之前投资的储备余额提取出来，供本次探索使用。每次消耗若干数量的系统余额，提取1源石锭。</span></span></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img id=\"40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0\" title=\"分隔栏小.png\" alt=\"分隔栏小.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/40ae686c9d61b4c0462012c0e19a45c0.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"6643bca6cd62f0c82c48b81e9ea182ba\" title=\"25.png\" alt=\"25.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/6643bca6cd62f0c82c48b81e9ea182ba.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\"></p><p></p><h6 style=\"text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">*图片仅供参考</span></h6>",
